 "remarks": "Start over or reimagine in one of Westport's most convenient settings. 3 Allen Lane offers a level .54-acre parcel on a quiet cul-de-sac, an increasingly hard-to-find opportunity for buyers and builders alike. Located in the A zone with public water and sewer connected, the property offers lots of potential: build a new custom home, expand, or renovate, subject to town approvals. The existing 3-bedroom Cape with two full baths, a half bath, and a finished lower level offers the option to live in the home now while planning for the future. Tucked away in a peaceful neighborhood yet minutes to downtown Westport, the Westport and Greens Farms Metro-North stations, schools, shopping, restaurants, and Compo Beach. Whether you envision a new home designed around today's lifestyle or a thoughtful transformation of a classic Cape, 3 Allen Lane combines location, land, and opportunity.",
